<div class="wise-connection-layout"><div>
<section class="wise-card" id="wise-connection"><div class="wise-card-heading"><div><span class="writer-kicker">Step 1</span><h2>Connect your Wise account</h2></div><span class="wise-pill"><?=$hasToken?'Token saved securely':'Setup needed'?></span></div><p>Use an API token from your own Wise account. Your token stays encrypted and is never shown publicly.</p>
<form method="post" class="wise-connection-form"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="api_save"><input type="hidden" name="api_version" value="<?=(int)($api['version']??0)?>">
<div class="wise-field-grid"><div class="wise-field"><label for="wise-api-environment">Environment</label><select id="wise-api-environment" name="environment"><option value="production" <?=($api['environment']??'production')==='production'?'selected':''?>>Live account</option><option value="sandbox" <?=($api['environment']??'')==='sandbox'?'selected':''?>>Sandbox · testing</option></select></div><div class="wise-field"><label for="wise-api-profile">Wise profile ID</label><input id="wise-api-profile" name="profile" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[1-9][0-9]*" maxlength="30" value="<?=e($api['profile']??'')?>" placeholder="Your numeric profile ID" required><small>The profile you use to receive support. <a href="https://docs.wise.com/api-reference/profile/profilelist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find your profile ID</a></small></div><div class="wise-field wise-wide"><label for="wise-api-token">API token <?=$hasToken?'· saved':''?></label><input id="wise-api-token" type="password" name="api_token" autocomplete="new-password" maxlength="5000" placeholder="<?=$hasToken?'Leave blank to keep the saved token':'Paste your Wise API token'?>"><small><a href="https://wise.com/settings/api-tokens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get a token in Wise ↗</a> · Never use your Wise password here.</small></div></div>
