<button class="wbtn primary">Save secure connection</button></form></section>
<section class="wise-card"><div class="wise-card-heading"><div><span class="writer-kicker">Step 2</span><h2>Verify access</h2></div><span class="wise-pill <?=$verified?'is-ready':''?>"><?=$verified?'Profile verified':'Not verified'?></span></div><p>Check that the token can read the selected profile and its EUR, USD and GBP currency accounts. This does not move money.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="api_probe"><input type="hidden" name="api_version" value="<?=(int)($api['version']??0)?>"><button class="wbtn" <?=!$hasToken?'disabled':''?>>Verify profile & currencies</button></form><?php if(!$hasToken):?><p class="wise-muted">Save the token and profile ID above to enable this check.</p><?php endif;?>
<?php if(!empty($probe['balances'])):?><details class="wise-advanced"><summary>Check statement access</summary><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="api_statement"><input type="hidden" name="api_version" value="<?=(int)($api['version']??0)?>"><div class="wise-field"><label for="wise-balance">Currency account</label><select id="wise-balance" name="balance"><?php foreach($probe['balances']as$balance):?><option value="<?=e($balance['id'])?>"><?=e($balance['currency'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><p>Read-only check for the last 24 hours. The statement is not stored and no contribution is confirmed.</p><button class="wbtn">Check statement access</button></form><p><?=e($probe['statements']??'Not tested')?></p></details><?php endif;?></section>
<section class="wise-card"><div class="wise-card-heading"><div><span class="writer-kicker">Private activity</span><h2>Receiving events</h2></div><span class="wise-pill"><?=!empty($api['webhook_enabled'])?'Receiver enabled':'Receiver off'?></span></div><?php $events=wise_api_events();if(!$events):?><div class="wise-empty"><span aria-hidden="true">↙</span><h3>No verified events yet</h3><p>After account verification and webhook setup, signed events appear here for reconciliation.</p></div><?php else:?><div class="wise-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Currency</th><th>Amount</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($events as$event):?><tr><td><?=e($event['currency']??'')?></td><td><?=e($event['amount']??'')?></td><td><?=e($event['direction']??'')?></td><td><?=e($event['status']??'')?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><?php endif;?><p class="wise-muted">An event is reviewed against payment records before any acknowledgement. Automatic matching and receipts are not active.</p></section>
