<details class="wise-card wise-help"><summary>Webhook setup reference</summary><p>Register this exact callback in Wise, then save its subscription ID in the optional settings.</p><label>Callback URL</label><code><?=e(url('/webhooks/wise'))?></code><label>Event</label><code>balances#update</code><label>Schema</label><code>4.0.0</code><p>Wise test callbacks may need retrying after you save and enable the subscription. Signatures, profile and subscription must match.</p><a href="https://docs.wise.com/guides/developer/webhooks/subscribe-to-webhooks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wise setup guide ↗</a></details>
<details class="wise-card wise-help"><summary>Access & account eligibility</summary><p>Wise API and statement access depend on the account’s country, profile and permissions. This connection has no outgoing transfer, conversion or recipient-creation operation.</p><a href="https://docs.wise.com/guides/developer/auth-and-security/personal-api-token" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check Wise access requirements ↗</a></details></aside></div>
